{"id":"e5499663d4761f00","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-uniform-derandomization.md","title":"统一硬度下的无穷多长度平均去随机化","display":"thm-uniform-derandomization — 统一硬度下的无穷多长度平均去随机化","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-uniform-derandomization","aliases":["28-thm-uniform-derandomization"],"display":"thm-uniform-derandomization — 统一硬度下的无穷多长度平均去随机化","depends_on":["[[28-df-bpp]]","[[28-df-exp]]","[[28-df-tm]]","[[28-df-machine-resources]]","[[28-df-characteristic-language]]"],"source_book_location":"Theorem 20.16","source_printed_pages":"413","source_pdf_pages":"439","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_proof_reviewed":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revision":"R5","verification_status":"statement-compared; proof-not-independently-verified"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-uniform-derandomization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-uniform-derandomization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-uniform-derandomization — 统一硬度下的无穷多长度平均去随机化"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"073a1a66749fa84e\" href=\"?note=073a1a66749fa84e\" title=\"28-df-bpp\">28-df-bpp</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5e2f71764c556aa9\" href=\"?note=5e2f71764c556aa9\" title=\"28-df-exp\">28-df-exp</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1965e2b0765554c9\" href=\"?note=1965e2b0765554c9\" title=\"28-df-tm\">28-df-tm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" href=\"?note=b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" title=\"28-df-machine-resources\">28-df-machine-resources</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f982c99aef3f369e\" href=\"?note=f982c99aef3f369e\" title=\"28-df-characteristic-language\">28-df-characteristic-language</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"Theorem 20.16"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"413"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"439"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revision","html":"R5"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-compared; proof-not-independently-verified"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{BPP},\\mathbf{EXP},\\mathrm{TM},\\operatorname{time}_M,M(x)\">\\(\\mathbf{BPP},\\mathbf{EXP},\\mathrm{TM},\\operatorname{time}_M,M(x)\\)</span> 分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"073a1a66749fa84e\" href=\"?note=073a1a66749fa84e\" title=\"28-df-bpp\">28-df-bpp</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5e2f71764c556aa9\" href=\"?note=5e2f71764c556aa9\" title=\"28-df-exp\">28-df-exp</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"1965e2b0765554c9\" href=\"?note=1965e2b0765554c9\" title=\"28-df-tm\">28-df-tm</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" href=\"?note=b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" title=\"28-df-machine-resources\">28-df-machine-resources</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_L\">\\(\\chi_L\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"f982c99aef3f369e\" href=\"?note=f982c99aef3f369e\" title=\"28-df-characteristic-language\">28-df-characteristic-language</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle b\\rangle\">\\(\\langle b\\rangle\\)</span> 是比特 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\">\\(b\\)</span> 的单字符字串；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\log_2\">\\(\\log_2\\)</span> 为二底对数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\">\\(\\eta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\)</span> 是时间指数参数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n_0\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n_0\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N,n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(N,n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span> 为长度阈值或长度，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\">\\(x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\\mathbf{BPP}\\ne\\mathbf{EXP}\\Longrightarrow\\forall L\\in\\mathbf{BPP}\\;\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;[&amp;\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;M(x)\\in\\{\\langle0\\rangle,\\langle1\\rangle\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\eta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists n_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;(|x|\\ge n_0\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{time}_M(x)\\le2^{|x|^\\eta})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall N\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge N}\\quad2^{-n}|\\{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n:M(x)=\\langle\\chi_L(x)\\rangle\\}|\\ge1-1/n].\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\\mathbf{BPP}\\ne\\mathbf{EXP}\\Longrightarrow\\forall L\\in\\mathbf{BPP}\\;\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;[&amp;\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;M(x)\\in\\{\\langle0\\rangle,\\langle1\\rangle\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\eta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists n_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;(|x|\\ge n_0\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{time}_M(x)\\le2^{|x|^\\eta})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall N\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge N}\\quad2^{-n}|\\{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n:M(x)=\\langle\\chi_L(x)\\rangle\\}|\\ge1-1/n].\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保持“无穷多长度、该长度上均匀分布平均成功”的原结论，既不升级为所有长度也不升级为逐输入正确。单台 M 满足每个 η 的最终界，显式表达 2<sup>{n</sup>{o(1)}} 时间。原书还讨论可采样分布加强版，此节点不引入该加强。已核对陈述；完整证明依赖永久式的自归约和统一重建，未独立复核。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 Arora–Barak PDF，Theorem 20.16；印刷页 413；PDF 页 439。</p>\n<p>本次接口修订：显式限定时间指数、输入字串和无穷多长度量词的论域；算法统一性、亚指数时间界及平均成功率均保持原断言。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-bpp","status":"resolved","id":"073a1a66749fa84e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-bpp]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-exp","status":"resolved","id":"5e2f71764c556aa9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-exp]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-tm","status":"resolved","id":"1965e2b0765554c9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-tm]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-machine-resources","status":"resolved","id":"b5d4fc2d291ce98b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-machine-resources]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-characteristic-language","status":"resolved","id":"f982c99aef3f369e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-characteristic-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-bpp","status":"resolved","id":"073a1a66749fa84e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf{BPP},\\mathbf{EXP},\\mathrm{TM},\\operatorname{time}_M,M(x)$ 分别见 [[28-df-bpp]]、[[28-df-exp]]、[[28-df-tm]]、[[28-df-machine-resources]]。$\\chi_L$ 见 [[28-df-characteristic-language]]，$\\langle b\\rangle$ 是比特 $b$ 的单字符字串；$\\log_2$ 为二底对数；$\\eta\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}$ 是时间指数参数，$n_0\\in\\mathbb N$、$N,n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$ 为长度阈值或长度，$x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*$。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-exp","status":"resolved","id":"5e2f71764c556aa9","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf{BPP},\\mathbf{EXP},\\mathrm{TM},\\operatorname{time}_M,M(x)$ 分别见 [[28-df-bpp]]、[[28-df-exp]]、[[28-df-tm]]、[[28-df-machine-resources]]